### Chats - Create
POST {{apiRoot}}/api/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "My Chat"
}

### Chats - List
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Accept: application/json

### Chats - Get by ID
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Accept: application/json

### Chats - Add message
PUT {{apiRoot}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"content": "Hello from api.http",
	"role": "user"
}

### Chats - Delete
DELETE {{apiRoot}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
